Q: The same classes for opening hidden blocks A: <p><a href="https://codepen.io/julia-faizova/pen/LEbjmRZ" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Here is demo</a> on codepen for my situation. Thank you!</p>
<pre><code>import $ from &quot;https://esm.sh/jquery&quot;;
$(&quot;.bottom button&quot;).click(function (event) {
  $(this).toggleClass(&quot;toggled&quot;);
  $(&quot;.bottom span&quot;).toggle(&quot;slow&quot;);
});
</code></pre>
